# --- Go embed tree (v0.14.2) ---
# cmd/freeiran/frontend/dist is EPHEMERAL GENERATED OUTPUT, never
# committed: it is staged by `npm run build:embed` (frontend/scripts/
# copy-dist.mjs) and consumed by go:embed at compile time. CI stages
# it per-job (or transfers it as the freeiran-frontend-embed artifact
# to the desktop-validation job). Keep it untracked so a local
# frontend build can never reintroduce generated output into Git.
cmd/freeiran/frontend/dist/
.npm/
npm-debug.log*

# --- CI protocol-core installs ---
.cores/

